# shooter, map indoor: a closed room with two shadowed lamps
# (REQ-DEMO-030, REQ-DEMO-031).
#
# `shooter --map indoor` plays this script. The room has no sun and no
# bots. Light 1 hangs still at the centre: its cube shadow map is drawn
# one time. Light 2 moves on a rail near the ceiling. L sends it to the
# other end at a constant speed (5 seconds for the full rail). A press
# during a move turns it round. Each crate casts one shadow from each
# lamp. The checkpoints hash the frames for scripts/demos-check.sh
# (REQ-DEMO-003, REQ-DEMO-029).
0 set time 0.37
0 set snow on
0 set clouds on
0 set fog on
0 set shadows on
0 set exposure 0.8
0 set indoor_ambient 0.04
0 set bots_hold on
0 set god on
0 set follow -1
0 set trace off
0 caption An indoor room: no sun, two lamps with cube shadow maps
# Look down 12 degrees, at the crates and their shadows.
10 mouse move 0 8
11 mouse move 0 16
12 mouse move 0 24
13 mouse move 0 32
14 mouse move 0 40
15 mouse move 0 48
16 mouse move 0 56
17 mouse move 0 64
18 mouse move 0 72
19 mouse move 0 80
20 mouse move 0 88
21 mouse move 0 96
60 checkpoint light2_west
90 caption L moves light 2 along the rail. Each crate casts two shadows
90 key L down
95 key L up
240 checkpoint light2_middle
400 checkpoint light2_east
420 caption A press during a move turns the lamp round
420 key L down
425 key L up
# The gamepad north button does the same as L.
495 pad north down
500 pad north up
540 checkpoint turned
600 caption The player walks in the room with the gun
600 key A down
650 key A up
650 key Right down
665 key Right up
720 checkpoint walk
760 caption Shadows off: the light of each lamp reaches each place
760 set shadows off
800 checkpoint no_shadows
820 end
